<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Automation in Surgical Robotics</title>
  <meta name="description" content="What's automated in surgical robotics today, what's coming next, and how it's actually built." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/reveal.js@5.1.0/dist/reveal.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/katex.min.css" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b1020;
      --surface: #131c38;
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      --text: #edf2ff;
      --muted: #aab4d2;
      --faint: #707a99;
      --cyan: #47e5ff;
      --violet: #9b7cff;
      --green: #4fe3a3;
      --amber: #ffca6a;
      --red: #ff7a8a;
      --ink: #07101f;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      background:
        radial-gradient(900px 560px at 78% 10%, rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.12), transparent 62%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1020 0%, #101832 48%, #101426 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    .reveal {
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .reveal .slides { text-align: left; }
    .reveal section { padding: 16px 10px; overflow: hidden; }

    .reveal h1,
    .reveal h2,
    .reveal h3 {
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      line-height: 1.04;
      text-transform: none;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .reveal h1 { font-size: 2.08em; max-width: 22ch; }
    .reveal h2 { font-size: 1.38em; max-width: 30ch; }
    .reveal h3 { font-size: 0.86em; line-height: 1.18; }
    .reveal p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.36; margin: 0; }
    .reveal strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 750; }
    .reveal em { color: var(--text); font-style: italic; }
    .reveal a { color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: none; }
    .reveal code { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "Courier New", monospace; font-size: 0.9em; color: var(--cyan); }

    .slide-shell {
      --fit-scale: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
      min-height: 630px;
      gap: 16px;
      transform: scale(var(--fit-scale));
      transform-origin: top left;
    }

    .footerline {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      color: var(--faint);
      font-size: 0.5em;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .slide-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .slide-header .kicker {
      font-size: 0.84em;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .slide-header .brand {
      font-size: 0.72em;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .slide-header .brand-mark {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
      letter-spacing: 0;
      text-transform: none;
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.25em;
    }

    .brand .brand-text {
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan), var(--violet));
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
    }

    .footerline .brand-text {
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: none;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1em;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .tag::before {
      content: "";
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.7);
    }

    .kicker {
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-size: 0.56em;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .reveal .lede { font-size: 0.66em; max-width: 980px; margin-top: 16px; color: var(--muted); }

    .hero-layout,
    .split-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.02fr 0.98fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .panel,
    .metric,
    .persona,
    .milestone,
    .flow-step {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035));
      box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .outline-cyan,
    .persona {
      border-color: rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.28);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.075), rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.025));
    }

    .outline-amber {
      border-color: rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.32);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.075), rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.02));
    }

    .outline-violet {
      border-color: rgba(155, 124, 255, 0.32);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(155, 124, 255, 0.07), rgba(155, 124, 255, 0.02));
    }

    .outline-red {
      border-color: rgba(255, 122, 138, 0.32);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 122, 138, 0.07), rgba(255, 122, 138, 0.02));
    }

    .grid-2,
    .grid-3,
    .grid-4,
    .metric-grid,
    .timeline,
    .flow {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    .metric-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    .timeline { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    .flow { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin-top: 16px; }

    .panel h3,
    .persona h3,
    .milestone h3 { margin-bottom: 7px; }
    .panel p,
    .persona p,
    .milestone p { font-size: 0.56em; }
    .panel ul { margin: 10px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .panel li {
      color: var(--muted);
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 18px;
      font-size: 0.52em;
      line-height: 1.34;
      margin: 6px 0;
    }
    .panel li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0.55em;
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      background: var(--cyan);
    }
    .panel.outline-amber li::before { background: var(--amber); }
    .panel.outline-violet li::before { background: var(--violet); }
    .panel.outline-red li::before { background: var(--red); }

    .callout {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.26);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .callout.amber {
      border-color: rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.3);
      background: rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.07);
    }

    .callout strong { font-size: 0.78em; }
    .callout span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.56em; line-height: 1.32; }

    .problem-stack { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    .problem-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    }

    .problem-row strong { font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 0.9em; }
    .problem-row p { font-size: 0.54em; }
    .icon-box { width: 54px; height: 54px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 8px; color: var(--ink); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan), var(--green)); font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.76em; }
    .icon-box.amber { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--amber), var(--violet)); }
    .icon-box.violet { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--violet), var(--cyan)); }

    .flow-step {
      min-height: 146px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .flow-step h3 { margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .flow-step p { font-size: 0.56em; }

    .step-no { color: var(--cyan); font-size: 0.54em; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .mock-box { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface); padding: 10px; }
    .mock-line { height: 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); margin: 7px 0; }
    .mock-line.short { width: 56%; }
    .mock-line.medium { width: 74%; }
    .mock-chip { display: inline-flex; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 9px; background: rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.14); color: var(--cyan); font-size: 0.5em; font-weight: 700; }
    .mock-chip.amber { background: rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.14); color: var(--amber); }

    .market-plot {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
    }
    .market-stage {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 86px 108px 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .market-label { color: var(--cyan); font-size: 0.62em; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .market-value { color: var(--text); font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 1.0em; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; }
    .market-bar { display: grid; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; }
    .market-track { height: 18px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.065); overflow: hidden; }
    .market-fill { width: var(--size); height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.3)); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.24); }
    .market-scope { display: grid; gap: 2px; }
    .market-scope strong { font-size: 0.58em; }
    .market-scope span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.5em; line-height: 1.22; }

    .big-stat {
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.42em;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 0.95;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .metric { text-align: left; }
    .metric .num { display: block; color: var(--cyan); font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; }
    .metric .lbl { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.5em; line-height: 1.22; margin-top: 8px; }

    .milestone { position: relative; min-height: 160px; }
    .milestone::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(79, 227, 163, 0.55); margin-right: 10px; vertical-align: 0.02em; }
    .milestone.future::before { background: var(--amber); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.45); }
    .milestone.risk::before { background: var(--red); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 122, 138, 0.45); }
    .milestone h3 { display: inline; font-size: 0.72em; }
    .milestone p { font-size: 0.58em; line-height: 1.32; margin-top: 7px; }

    /* Hero / title slide */
    .hero-title {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr auto;
      gap: 24px;
      min-height: 100%;
    }
    .hero-title .eyebrow { color: var(--cyan); font-size: 0.56em; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .hero-title h1 { font-size: 2.4em; max-width: 18ch; }
    .hero-title .accent-cyan { color: var(--cyan); }
    .hero-title .accent-amber { color: var(--amber); }
    .hero-title .accent-violet { color: var(--violet); }
    .hero-title .by-line { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.56em; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* Section header */
    .section-shell {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
      min-height: 630px;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .section-hero {
      display: grid;
      align-content: center;
      gap: 22px;
      padding: 36px 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.10), rgba(155, 124, 255, 0.06));
      box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
    }
    .section-hero h1 { font-size: 2.4em; max-width: 22ch; }
    .section-hero .lede { font-size: 0.7em; max-width: 880px; }

    /* Tables */
    .reveal table.tech-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.56em; margin: 0; }
    .reveal table.tech-table th, .reveal table.tech-table td {
      padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-align: left; color: var(--muted); vertical-align: top;
    }
    .reveal table.tech-table th { color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.86em; }
    .reveal table.tech-table td.era { color: var(--text); font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; }
    .reveal table.tech-table tr.highlight td { color: var(--amber); font-weight: 700; }

    /* Strip of figures */
    .strip { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    .figure-frame {
      background: #ffffff; padding: 4px; border-radius: 6px;
      display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;
    }
    .figure-frame.dark { background: #07101f; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 6px; }
    .figure-frame img { display: block; max-width: 100%; max-height: 200px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .figure-frame.tall img { max-height: 360px; }
    .figure-frame.lg img { max-height: 280px; }
    .figure-frame.sm img { max-height: 130px; }
    .strip.compact .figure-frame img { max-height: 130px; }
    .figure-caption { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.46em; text-align: center; margin-top: 4px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* Formula / code blocks */
    .formula {
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      background: rgba(71, 229, 255, 0.06);
      padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 6px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--cyan);
      font-size: 0.6em; color: var(--text);
    }

    /* Autonomy / V&V ladder */
    .levels { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
    .levels li {
      padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 6px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.56em;
      line-height: 1.34;
    }
    .levels li .lv { display: inline-block; min-width: 72px; font-family: "Space Grotesk", Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; color: var(--cyan); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
    .levels li.amber .lv { color: var(--amber); }
    .levels li.red .lv { color: var(--red); }

    /* Pull quote */
    .pullquote {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.32);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--amber);
      background: rgba(255, 202, 106, 0.06);
      padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 6px;
      color: var(--text); font-size: 0.66em; font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.42;
    }

    /* Reveal controls */
    .reveal .controls { color: var(--cyan); transform: scale(0.65); transform-origin: bottom right; }
    .reveal .progress { color: var(--cyan); height: 5px; }
    .reveal .slide-number { color: var(--muted); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); font-size: 11px; }

    /* Bilingual support */
    html[lang="en"] [data-lang="bg"] { display: none !important; }
    html[lang="bg"] [data-lang="en"] { display: none !important; }

    /* Language toggle */
    #lang-toggle {
      position: fixed; top: 14px; right: 14px; z-index: 1000;
      display: flex; gap: 4px;
      background: rgba(7, 16, 31, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    }
    #lang-toggle button {
      background: transparent; color: var(--muted); border: none;
      padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      cursor: pointer; line-height: 1;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    }
    #lang-toggle button:hover { color: var(--text); }
    #lang-toggle button.active { background: var(--cyan); color: var(--ink); }
    #lang-toggle .flag { font-size: 14px; }

    @media (max-width: 1000px), (max-height: 650px) {
      .reveal { font-size: 22px; }
      .reveal section { padding: 14px 8px; }
      .reveal h1 { font-size: 1.98em; }
      .reveal h2 { font-size: 1.32em; }
      .slide-shell { min-height: 570px; gap: 14px; }
      .hero-layout, .split-layout { gap: 24px; }
      .reveal .lede { font-size: 0.66em; margin-top: 14px; }
      .panel, .metric, .persona, .milestone, .flow-step { padding: 12px; }
      .problem-row { padding: 12px; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; }
      .icon-box { width: 48px; height: 48px; }
      .flow-step { min-height: 150px; padding: 13px; }
      .timeline { gap: 9px; }
      .milestone { padding: 12px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .reveal { font-size: 19px; }
      .reveal h1 { font-size: 1.9em; }
      .reveal h2 { font-size: 1.28em; max-width: 24ch; }
      .hero-layout, .split-layout, .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .grid-3, .grid-4, .metric-grid, .flow, .timeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .slide-shell { min-height: auto; gap: 14px; }
      .footerline { font-size: 0.46em; }
      .market-stage { grid-template-columns: 56px 86px 1fr; gap: 9px; }
      .market-plot { padding: 10px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div id="lang-toggle" aria-label="Language">
    <button data-set-lang="en" type="button"><span class="flag">🇬🇧</span><span>EN</span></button>
    <button data-set-lang="bg" type="button"><span class="flag">🇧🇬</span><span>BG</span></button>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="slides">

      <!-- ============================================================
           PHASE 1 — HOOK
           ============================================================ -->

      <!-- 1. Title -->
      <section>
        <div class="slide-shell">
          <div class="slide-header">
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="en">devbg IoT · 2026</div>
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="bg">devbg IoT · 2026</div>
            <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">SR</span><span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-title">
            <span class="eyebrow" data-lang="en">A working tour</span>
            <span class="eyebrow" data-lang="bg">Работен преглед</span>
            <h1 data-lang="en"><span class="accent-cyan">Automation</span> in <span class="accent-amber">Surgical Robotics</span></h1>
            <h1 data-lang="bg"><span class="accent-cyan">Автоматизация</span> в <span class="accent-amber">хирургичната роботика</span></h1>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="en">What's automated today, what's coming next, and how it's actually built — from the cart in the OR to the policy network on the GPU.</p>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="bg">Какво е автоматизирано днес, какво идва, и как реално се изгражда — от карта в залата до policy мрежата на GPU‑то.</p>
            <div class="by-line" data-lang="en">David Mavrodiev · devbg IoT · 2026</div>
            <div class="by-line" data-lang="bg">David Mavrodiev · devbg IoT · 2026</div>
          </div>
          <div class="footerline">
            <span data-lang="en">Six parts: robots · tasks · stack · techniques · case study · road ahead</span>
            <span data-lang="bg">Шест части: роботи · задачи · стек · техники · case study · път напред</span>
            <span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="notes">
          Здравейте! Темата днес е автоматизация в хирургичната роботика —
          какво вече работи в операционните зали, какво се изследва, и как
          всичко това се изгражда технически.
        </aside>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Hook -->
      <section>
        <div class="slide-shell">
          <div class="slide-header">
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="en">The Premise</div>
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="bg">Постановката</div>
            <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">SR</span><span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-layout">
            <div>
              <h1 data-lang="en">Surgery is becoming a <span style="color: var(--amber);">software problem</span>.</h1>
              <h1 data-lang="bg">Хирургията се превръща в <span style="color: var(--amber);">софтуерен проблем</span>.</h1>
              <p class="lede" data-lang="en">For a hundred years surgery was a <strong>craft</strong>, practiced by hand. For the last twenty‑five it has been <strong>remote control</strong>, with a surgeon at a console driving a robot at the table. For the next twenty‑five it will be <strong>computer‑assisted</strong>, and increasingly <strong>autonomous</strong> for the parts a machine does better than a human.</p>
              <p class="lede" data-lang="bg">Сто години хирургията беше <strong>занаят</strong>, практикуван на ръка. През последните двадесет и пет се превърна в <strong>дистанционно управление</strong> — хирург на конзола и робот на масата. През следващите двадесет и пет ще бъде <strong>компютърно асистирана</strong>, и все по‑често <strong>автономна</strong> за нещата, които машината прави по‑добре от човек.</p>
            </div>
