      <!-- 28. The problem -->
      <section>
        <div class="slide-shell">
          <div class="slide-header">
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="en">Vascular Clip Application</div>
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="bg">Поставяне на съдов клипс</div>
            <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">SR</span><span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 data-lang="en">Dissect → plan → approach → center → <span style="color: var(--amber);">squeeze</span> → fire.</h2>
            <h2 data-lang="bg">Дисекция → план → доближаване → центриране → <span style="color: var(--amber);">стискане</span> → изстрелване.</h2>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="en">We zoom into one step — the pre‑firing <strong>squeeze</strong>. Sub‑mm precision, narrow safety window, must hold steady before the clip is fired.</p>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="bg">Фокусираме върху една стъпка — <strong>стискането</strong> преди изстрелване. Под‑милиметрова точност, тесен прозорец на безопасност, трябва да задържи стабилно преди клипсът да бъде изстрелян.</p>
            <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 18px; justify-items: center;">
              <div class="figure-frame"><img src="images/thesis/procedure/step_1.png" alt="step 1" style="max-height: 130px;"/><div class="figure-caption">01</div></div>
              <div class="figure-frame"><img src="images/thesis/procedure/step_2.png" alt="step 2" style="max-height: 130px;"/><div class="figure-caption">02</div></div>
              <div class="figure-frame"><img src="images/thesis/procedure/step_3.png" alt="step 3" style="max-height: 130px;"/><div class="figure-caption">03</div></div>
              <div class="figure-frame"><img src="images/thesis/procedure/step_4.png" alt="step 4" style="max-height: 130px;"/><div class="figure-caption">04</div></div>
              <div class="figure-frame"><img src="images/thesis/procedure/step_5.png" alt="step 5" style="max-height: 130px;"/><div class="figure-caption">05</div></div>
              <div class="figure-frame"><img src="images/thesis/procedure/step_6.png" alt="step 6" style="max-height: 130px;"/><div class="figure-caption">06</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="callout amber" style="margin-top: 14px;">
              <strong data-lang="en">Why this step?</strong>
              <strong data-lang="bg">Защо тази стъпка?</strong>
              <span data-lang="en">Over‑squeeze damages the vessel wall. Under‑squeeze leaks. The safety window is narrow, and that's exactly what makes it interesting for a learned policy.</span>
              <span data-lang="bg">Прекомерно стискане уврежда стената. Недостатъчно — изтича. Прозорецът на безопасност е тесен — именно това прави задачата интересна за научена политика.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="footerline">
            <span data-lang="en">Six steps. We learn one. Sub‑mm precision, tight safety window.</span>
            <span data-lang="bg">Шест стъпки. Учим една. Под‑милиметрова точност, тесен safety window.</span>
            <span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 29. How it's framed -->
      <section>
        <div class="slide-shell">
          <div class="slide-header">
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="en">How We Frame It</div>
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="bg">Как формулираме задачата</div>
            <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">SR</span><span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 data-lang="en">The hardest part of applying RL is rarely training — <span style="color: var(--cyan);">it's the four boxes below.</span></h2>
            <h2 data-lang="bg">Най‑трудната част в RL не е обучението — <span style="color: var(--cyan);">а четирите кутии по‑долу.</span></h2>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="en"><em>What does the agent see, what does it do, what counts as good, and where does it learn?</em> Get those wrong and no algorithm will save you.</p>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="bg"><em>Какво вижда агентът, какво прави, какво е добро и къде учи?</em> Ако тези са грешни, никакъв алгоритъм няма да те спаси.</p>
            <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top: 16px;">
              <div class="panel outline-cyan">
                <h3>State (4‑D)</h3>
                <div class="formula" style="margin: 6px 0;">$[\,\theta,\; u_{\text{prev}},\; r,\; \tau\,]$</div>
                <p data-lang="en">Jaw angle, last action, vessel radius, wall thickness.</p>
                <p data-lang="bg">Ангел на челюстите, предишно action, радиус на съда, дебелина на стената.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="panel outline-amber">
                <h3 data-lang="en">Action (1‑D continuous)</h3>
                <h3 data-lang="bg">Action (1‑D непрекъснато)</h3>
                <div class="formula" style="margin: 6px 0;">$u \in [-1, +1] \;\to\; \theta_{\text{cmd}}$</div>
                <p data-lang="en">A single continuous knob that sets the commanded jaw angle.</p>
                <p data-lang="bg">Един непрекъснат параметър, който задава желания ангел на челюстите.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="panel outline-cyan">
                <h3 data-lang="en">Reward (sculpted)</h3>
                <h3 data-lang="bg">Reward (формована)</h3>
                <ul style="margin-top: 6px;">
                  <li data-lang="en"><strong>+ accuracy.</strong> Quadratic penalty on (θ − θ*)².</li>
                  <li data-lang="bg"><strong>+ точност.</strong> Квадратична пенализация върху (θ − θ*)².</li>
                  <li data-lang="en"><strong>− safety.</strong> Large penalty near the damage threshold.</li>
                  <li data-lang="bg"><strong>− безопасност.</strong> Голяма пенализация близо до прага на увреждане.</li>
                  <li data-lang="en"><strong>− smoothness.</strong> Penalty on |Δu|.</li>
                  <li data-lang="bg"><strong>− плавност.</strong> Пенализация върху |Δu|.</li>
                  <li data-lang="en"><strong>+ success bonus</strong> for a stable hold.</li>
                  <li data-lang="bg"><strong>+ бонус за успех</strong> при стабилно задържане.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="panel outline-amber">
                <h3>Setup</h3>
                <ul style="margin-top: 6px;">
                  <li data-lang="en"><strong>Algorithm.</strong> PPO, model‑free policy gradient.</li>
                  <li data-lang="bg"><strong>Алгоритъм.</strong> PPO, model‑free policy gradient.</li>
                  <li data-lang="en"><strong>Simulator.</strong> SurRoL / PyBullet.</li>
                  <li data-lang="bg"><strong>Симулатор.</strong> SurRoL / PyBullet.</li>
                  <li data-lang="en"><strong>Training.</strong> ~400k steps on a laptop GPU.</li>
                  <li data-lang="bg"><strong>Обучение.</strong> ~400k стъпки на laptop GPU.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="footerline">
            <span data-lang="en">State · action · reward · setup. The four boxes that decide everything.</span>
            <span data-lang="bg">State · action · reward · setup. Четирите кутии, които решават всичко.</span>
            <span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 30. The learned behavior -->
      <section>
        <div class="slide-shell">
          <div class="slide-header">
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="en">The Learned Behavior</div>
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="bg">Наученото поведение</div>
            <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">SR</span><span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 data-lang="en">Approach fast → freeze. <span style="color: var(--cyan);">Two phases emerged, untouched by hand.</span></h2>
            <h2 data-lang="bg">Бързо приближаване → задържане. <span style="color: var(--cyan);">Две фази възникнаха сами.</span></h2>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="en">Four frames of the policy squeezing a vessel. Nobody programmed these two phases — they <strong>emerged</strong> from the reward function.</p>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="bg">Четири кадъра от един епизод. Никой не е програмирал тези две фази — те <strong>възникнаха</strong> от reward функцията.</p>
            <div class="grid-4" style="margin-top: 18px;">
