      <!-- 31. Deployment envelope -->
      <section>
        <div class="slide-shell">
          <div class="slide-header">
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="en">Deployment Envelope</div>
            <div class="kicker" data-lang="bg">Deployment envelope</div>
            <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">SR</span><span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 data-lang="en">A learned policy <span style="color: var(--amber);">never reaches a patient on its own</span>.</h2>
            <h2 data-lang="bg">Научената политика <span style="color: var(--amber);">никога не стига до пациент сама</span>.</h2>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="en">It sits inside a deterministic envelope. The interesting engineering isn't the network — it's the three boxes around it.</p>
            <p class="lede" data-lang="bg">Тя живее в детерминистична обвивка. Интересната инженерна работа не е мрежата — а трите кутии около нея.</p>
            <div class="grid-4" style="margin-top: 16px;">
              <div class="panel outline-cyan">
                <h3>Policy</h3>
                <p data-lang="en">PPO network. Outputs a <em>reference</em> jaw angle, not a torque or a velocity. Runs at 50 Hz — fast enough to keep up with the surgeon, slow enough that the supervisor below can sanity‑check every step.</p>
                <p data-lang="bg">PPO мрежа. Извежда <em>reference</em> ангел, не torque или скорост. Работи на 50 Hz — достатъчно бързо, и достатъчно бавно, за да може supervisorът да проверява всяка стъпка.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="panel outline-cyan">
                <h3 data-lang="en">Geometric guard</h3>
                <h3 data-lang="bg">Geometric guard</h3>
                <p data-lang="en">A pure‑code clamp on θ<sub>cmd</sub>: never inside the damage band, never outside the workspace, never moving faster than the actuator allows. No ML, ~50 lines, easy to certify under IEC 62304.</p>
                <p data-lang="bg">Чистокодов clamp върху θ<sub>cmd</sub>: никога в зоната на увреждане, никога извън workspace, никога по‑бърз от това, което актуаторът позволява. ~50 реда, лесен за сертификация по IEC 62304.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="panel outline-amber">
                <h3 data-lang="en">Runtime monitor</h3>
                <h3 data-lang="bg">Runtime monitor</h3>
                <p data-lang="en">Watches |Δu|, action entropy, and prediction confidence in real time. If the policy starts thrashing or its confidence collapses, the monitor trips it out of the loop — the network is treated as a fallible component, not a source of truth.</p>
                <p data-lang="bg">Следи |Δu|, action entropy и prediction confidence в реално време. Ако политиката започне да припрясва или confidence ѝ падне, monitorът я изключва от цикъла.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="panel outline-red">
                <h3 data-lang="en">Watchdog &amp; safe state</h3>
                <h3 data-lang="bg">Watchdog и safe state</h3>
                <p data-lang="en">If inference misses even one frame, a hardware watchdog timer fires: the controller servos to the last‑good reference, the surgeon gets an audible alert, manual control is handed back. Failure‑tolerant by design, not by hope.</p>
                <p data-lang="bg">Ако inference пропусне дори един кадър, хардуерен watchdog таймер се изпълнява: контролерът прави servo до last‑good reference, хирургът получава звукова аларма, мануалният контрол се връща. Failure‑tolerant по дизайн.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 14px; text-align: center;" data-lang="en">
              The interesting engineering isn't the network. <strong>It's the three boxes around it.</strong>
            </p>
            <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 14px; text-align: center;" data-lang="bg">
              Интересната инженерна работа не е мрежата. <strong>А трите кутии около нея.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="footerline">
            <span data-lang="en">Policy + clamp + monitor + watchdog = a learned model you can deploy.</span>
            <span data-lang="bg">Policy + clamp + monitor + watchdog = научен модел, който може да деплойнеш.</span>
            <span class="brand-text">Surgical Robotics</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

